{"id":"fc84ef09de6f7fd1","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators.md","title":"Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画","display":"Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators","aliases":["14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators"],"display":"Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画","depends_on":["[[14-df-localic-topos]]","[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4831e90790611a73\" href=\"?note=4831e90790611a73\" title=\"14-df-localic-topos\">14-df-localic-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77d9af1e2dba8486\" href=\"?note=77d9af1e2dba8486\" title=\"14-df-disjoint-coproducts\">14-df-disjoint-coproducts</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-Grothendieck 拓扑斯；localic 条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4831e90790611a73\" href=\"?note=4831e90790611a73\" title=\"14-df-localic-topos\">14-df-localic-topos</a>；所有余积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 是指定终对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_U:U\\to1\">\\(!_U:U\\to1\\)</span> 是唯一箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为次终对象指该箭头为单态射。余积采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77d9af1e2dba8486\" href=\"?note=77d9af1e2dba8486\" title=\"14-df-disjoint-coproducts\">14-df-disjoint-coproducts</a> 的普遍性质，不预先选取未定义的余积对象记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsLocalicTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(U_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)^I\\ \\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_i,Q)\\ \\exists e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,A)\\ \\bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(!_{U_i})\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsLocalicTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(U_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)^I\\ \\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_i,Q)\\ \\exists e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,A)\\ \\bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(!_{U_i})\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.5 Theorem 1，印刷页 488；DjVu 第 250 图页。原书条件 (iii) 是由次终对象生成；本式以从次终对象的小余积满射到各对象的等价形式表达。正向：locale 开集的可表层为次终对象并生成全部层。反向：次终对象的集合骨架给一个序站点；其子对象框架 Sub(1) 及规范覆盖重建 E。Grothendieck 前提提供小余积与小生成性，旧稿缺此范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-localic-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4831e90790611a73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-localic-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-disjoint-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"77d9af1e2dba8486","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-localic-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4831e90790611a73","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-Grothendieck 拓扑斯；localic 条件见 [[14-df-localic-topos]]；所有余积为 $\\mathcal U$-小。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-disjoint-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"77d9af1e2dba8486","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$1$ 是指定终对象，$!_U:U\\to1$ 是唯一箭头；$U$ 为次终对象指该箭头为单态射。余积采用 [[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]] 的普遍性质，不预先选取未定义的余积对象记号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"!_U:U\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsLocalicTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(U_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)^I\\ \\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_i,Q)\\ \\exists e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,A)\\ \\bigl(&\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(!_{U_i})\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators|Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators]]"},{"id":"4831e90790611a73","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 IX.5 Localic Topoi，印刷页 488；DjVu 第 250 图页。明确 Grothendieck 范围，避免在缺任意小余积的初等拓扑斯上调用[[14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators]]的生成条件。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators|Theorem — localic 拓扑斯的次终对象生成刻画]]"}],"outgoing":["4831e90790611a73","2e748a8b3caef6a6","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","77d9af1e2dba8486"]}